            {
                "comment": "Professor Poulos is an amazing teacher. She always wants you to succeed and be a good writer. She put a lot of time and effort to give feedback on my essays and I learned a LOT. Professor Poulos is also a very caring person who supports her students. If you are taking an ESL course, I would highly recommend her.",
