            {
                "comment": "too much homework especially writing compared with other ESL teachers. She gives feedback but sometimes those feedbacks are abstract. There are a lot of peer review sessions in the classes but if you get a partner who is not good at writing you will not get any useful feedback to adjust your essay.",
