            {
                "comment": "I had Andy last semester, and the reason why I came to ratemyprofessor after 2 months into this new semester, is because she is awesome! I still remember her being a nice instructor. She tries to make the class very fun, and she is always encouraging to students. She tells us that she is always there for us to help us, and she always was!",
